# Fishing (1.2.0): the rod leaning on the chest of an awake loaf, a puddle at its front bottom corner.
# Drawn for the duck frame `loaf` placed 4 px further left than usual (frame at stage (0,8)); this
# sprite goes at stage (20,8) in every frame. rod-cast: rod up, bobber flying. rod-wait-1/2: the
# bobber bobs. rod-bite: bobber under, rings, tip pulled down. rod-reel: rod up, the line taut
# straight down from the tip (stage (36,18)); the 8x8 catch hangs with its top-left at stage (32,21).
name: fishing-rod
size: 20x32
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  G #6b4220
  R #d19a55
  M #8a93a6
  X #e8485a
  W #fffaf0
  l #bfe6f5
  B #4f9fd6
  D #2f6aa3

